        {
          "id": 682501550,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> The CMakeList assumed homebrew paths etc. when platform is Apple.\n\nThen why do my builds succeed when I don't have /usr/local/opt, just /usr/local/{bin,lib,...}?",
