        {
          "id": 682503892,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Because on earlier versions of homebrew on Intel, homebrew paths are the standard local paths.  That's why it was moved, is so it would stop \"taking over\" `/usr/local` you still have libs in `/usr/local/lib` in your case which is where homebrew on Intel would have linked them...",
          "author": {
            "id": 9765948,
            "username": "rickmark1",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Rick Mark",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/03e5a00720fe630053752df1fb44d033da122794c1e3aa4d130a0bacb83f4f52?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/rickmark1"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-09-20T21:50:17.486Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-09-20T21:50:17.486Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 117462608,
